</style>
<div class="panel">
  <div class="eyebrow" id="eyebrow">DAY 1 · A WIN</div>
  <div class="title" id="title">You stayed.</div>
  <div class="body" id="body1">You just practiced the pause. That's the skill.</div>
  <div class="body-soft" id="body2">The urge will come back. So will you.</div>
  <div class="factcard">
    <div class="factlabel">YOUR BODY, RIGHT NOW</div>
    <div class="factbody" id="factBody">In 20 minutes, your heart rate starts to drop. In 12 hours, carbon monoxide levels return to normal.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="body-soft" id="cta">Visit thriverlink.com — help for you or someone you love.</div>
  <div class="actions">
    <button id="btnBreathe" class="btn secondary">Go again</button>
    <button id="btnDone" class="btn primary">Done</button>
  </div>
  <button id="btnQuit" class="btn ghost">Quit</button>
</div>
